{"id":3308,"slug":"3308-request-validation-voi-nested-dtos-arrays-va-conditional-validation","category":"NestJS","subcategory":"Request Pipeline","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Request validation với nested DTOs, arrays và conditional validation?","question_en":"Request validation with nested DTOs, arrays, and conditional validation?","answer_vi":"**Nested DTOs** với `@ValidateNested()` và `@Type()`:\n```typescript\nimport { ValidateNested, IsArray, ArrayMinSize } from 'class-validator';\nimport { Type } from 'class-transformer';\n\nclass AddressDto {\n  @IsString() @Length(2, 100)\n  street: string;\n\n  @IsString() @Matches(/^\\d{5}$/)  // validator.js không có locale 'VN' (throws); mã bưu chính VN là 5 số\n  zipCode: string;\n}\n\nclass CreateUserDto {\n  @IsString() @MinLength(2)\n  name: string;\n\n  @ValidateNested()    // Validate nested object\n  @Type(() => AddressDto)  // Phải có @Type để transform\n  address: AddressDto;\n\n  @IsArray()\n  @ArrayMinSize(1)\n  @ValidateNested({ each: true })  // Validate từng item\n  @Type(() => AddressDto)\n  addresses: AddressDto[];\n}\n```\n\n**Conditional validation** với `@ValidateIf()`:\n```typescript\n@IsOptional()\npaymentMethod?: string;\n\n@ValidateIf(obj => obj.paymentMethod === 'CREDIT_CARD')\n@IsCreditCard()\ncardNumber?: string;  // Chỉ validate nếu paymentMethod là CREDIT_CARD\n```\n\nLưu ý: `@Type(() => NestedClass)` là bắt buộc cho `@ValidateNested()` — thiếu thì validation bỏ qua nested object","answer_en":"**Nested DTOs** with `@ValidateNested()` and `@Type()`:\n```typescript\nclass CreateUserDto {\n  @ValidateNested()\n  @Type(() => AddressDto)\n  address: AddressDto;\n\n  @ValidateNested({ each: true })\n  @Type(() => AddressDto)\n  addresses: AddressDto[];\n}\n```\n\n**Conditional validation** with `@ValidateIf()`:\n```typescript\n@ValidateIf(obj => obj.paymentMethod === 'CREDIT_CARD')\n@IsCreditCard()\ncardNumber?: string;\n```\n\nPitfall: `@Type(() => NestedClass)` is mandatory for `@ValidateNested()` — without it, nested validation is skipped.","answer_html_vi":"<p><strong>Nested DTOs</strong> với <code>@ValidateNested()</code> và <code>@Type()</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import { ValidateNested, IsArray, ArrayMinSize } from 'class-validator';\nimport { Type } from 'class-transformer';\n\nclass AddressDto {\n  @IsString() @Length(2, 100)\n  street: string;\n\n  @IsString() @Matches(/^\\d{5}$/)  // validator.js không có locale 'VN' (throws); mã bưu chính VN là 5 số\n  zipCode: string;\n}\n\nclass CreateUserDto {\n  @IsString() @MinLength(2)\n  name: string;\n\n  @ValidateNested()    // Validate nested object\n  @Type(() =&gt; AddressDto)  // Phải có @Type để transform\n  address: AddressDto;\n\n  @IsArray()\n  @ArrayMinSize(1)\n  @ValidateNested({ each: true })  // Validate từng item\n  @Type(() =&gt; AddressDto)\n  addresses: AddressDto[];\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ValidateNested</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IsArray</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ArrayMinSize</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;class-validator&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Type</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;class-transformer&#x27;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@IsString</span>() <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Length</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">100</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">street</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@IsString</span>() <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Matches</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/^\\d{5}$/</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// validator.js không có locale &#x27;VN&#x27; (throws); mã bưu chính VN là 5 số</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">zipCode</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CreateUserDto</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@IsString</span>() <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@MinLength</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@ValidateNested</span>()    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Validate nested object</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Type</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Phải có @Type để transform</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">address</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@IsArray</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@ArrayMinSize</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@ValidateNested</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">each</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> })  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Validate từng item</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Type</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addresses</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>[];\n}</code></pre></div><p><strong>Conditional validation</strong> với <code>@ValidateIf()</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@IsOptional()\npaymentMethod?: string;\n\n@ValidateIf(obj =&gt; obj.paymentMethod === 'CREDIT_CARD')\n@IsCreditCard()\ncardNumber?: string;  // Chỉ validate nếu paymentMethod là CREDIT_CARD\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@IsOptional</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">paymentMethod</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@ValidateIf</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">obj</span> =&gt;</span> obj.<span class=\"hljs-property\">paymentMethod</span> === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;CREDIT_CARD&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@IsCreditCard</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">cardNumber</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Chỉ validate nếu paymentMethod là CREDIT_CARD</span></code></pre></div><p>Lưu ý: <code>@Type(() =&gt; NestedClass)</code> là bắt buộc cho <code>@ValidateNested()</code> — thiếu thì validation bỏ qua nested object.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><strong>Nested DTOs</strong> with <code>@ValidateNested()</code> and <code>@Type()</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"class CreateUserDto {\n  @ValidateNested()\n  @Type(() =&gt; AddressDto)\n  address: AddressDto;\n\n  @ValidateNested({ each: true })\n  @Type(() =&gt; AddressDto)\n  addresses: AddressDto[];\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CreateUserDto</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@ValidateNested</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Type</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">address</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@ValidateNested</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">each</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> })\n  <span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Type</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">addresses</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AddressDto</span>[];\n}</code></pre></div><p><strong>Conditional validation</strong> with <code>@ValidateIf()</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@ValidateIf(obj =&gt; obj.paymentMethod === 'CREDIT_CARD')\n@IsCreditCard()\ncardNumber?: string;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@ValidateIf</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">obj</span> =&gt;</span> obj.<span class=\"hljs-property\">paymentMethod</span> === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;CREDIT_CARD&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">@IsCreditCard</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">cardNumber</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>;</code></pre></div><p>Pitfall: <code>@Type(() =&gt; NestedClass)</code> is mandatory for <code>@ValidateNested()</code> — without it, nested validation is skipped.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3264-giai-thich-request-lifecycle-trong-nestjs-middleware-guards-interceptors-pipes-c","title":"Giải thích Request Lifecycle trong NestJS: Middleware → Guards → Interceptors → Pipes → Controller → Exception Filters."},{"url":"/q/3265-guards-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-implement-jwt-auth-guard","title":"Guards trong NestJS là gì? Cách implement JWT Auth Guard?"},{"url":"/q/3266-pipes-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-dung-validationpipe-voi-class-validator","title":"Pipes trong NestJS là gì? Cách dùng ValidationPipe với class-validator?"},{"url":"/q/3267-interceptors-trong-nestjs-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao-neu-cac-use-case-pho-bien","title":"Interceptors trong NestJS hoạt động như thế nào? Nêu các use-case phổ biến."},{"url":"/q/3268-exception-filters-trong-nestjs-la-gi-cach-tao-global-error-handler","title":"Exception Filters trong NestJS là gì? Cách tạo global error handler."},{"url":"/q/3276-custom-decorators-trong-nestjs-cach-tao-currentuser-roles-public","title":"Custom Decorators trong NestJS — cách tạo @CurrentUser, @Roles, @Public?"},{"url":"/q/3279-middleware-trong-nestjs-functional-vs-class-middleware-apply-theo-routes","title":"Middleware trong NestJS — functional vs class middleware, apply theo routes?"},{"url":"/q/3260-nestjs-la-gi-tai-sao-nen-dung-nestjs-thay-vi-express-thuan","title":"NestJS là gì? Tại sao nên dùng NestJS thay vì Express thuần?"}]}